Source: onnxruntime-tts
Section: science
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Grigory Tuboltsev <gtubolcev@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake (>= 3.28), patch,
 dh-sequence-python3, python3-dev, python3-numpy
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://onnxruntime.ai
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libonnxruntime-tts
Architecture: amd64
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ONNX Runtime - private copy for the linux-tts speech modules
 ONNX Runtime runs machine learning models in the ONNX format. This is a
 newer release than the distribution's, built with the CPU execution
 provider only; its dependencies (protobuf, onnx, abseil, re2, ...) are
 linked in statically. It is installed in /usr/lib/<triplet>/linux-tts,
 apart from the distribution's libonnxruntime, for the speech modules of
 the linux-tts PPA and plugin execution providers such as onnx-vulkan-rs.

Package: libonnxruntime-tts-dev
Architecture: amd64
Section: libdevel
Depends: libonnxruntime-tts (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: ONNX Runtime - private copy for linux-tts (headers)
 ONNX Runtime runs machine learning models in the ONNX format.
 .
 This package has the headers of the C and C++ API in
 /usr/include/linux-tts/onnxruntime, and libonnxruntime.pc and the CMake
 package configuration in /usr/lib/<triplet>/linux-tts; set
 PKG_CONFIG_PATH or CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH to use it, and an RPATH to run.

Package: python3-onnxruntime-tts
Architecture: amd64
Section: python
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-numpy
Description: ONNX Runtime - private copy for linux-tts (Python module)
 ONNX Runtime runs machine learning models in the ONNX format.
 .
 This package has the Python module onnxruntime of the same release in
 /usr/lib/python3/linux-tts, off Python's search path, apart from the
 distribution's python3-onnxruntime; programs add the directory to
 sys.path themselves (silero-server of speech-dispatcher-silero).
